      "key": "shield.auxiliary",
      "variationKind": "form",
      "appliesTo": [
        "shield"
      ],
      "supersedes": [],
      "dataFields": [
        {
          "key": "encStone",
          "type": "number",
          "label": "Encumbrance (stone)"
        }
      ],
      "grantsAC": [
        "hand",
        "backVsRear"
      ],
      "mounted": "riderOrMount",
      "deniedWhen": [
        "surprised",
        "retreating",
        "attackedFromBehind"
      ],
      "mountedDeniedWhen": [
        "vulnerable"
      ]
    },
    "icon": "icons/svg/shield.svg",
    "variation": [
      {
        "field": "data.encStone",
        "from": {
          "into": "amount",
          "pattern": "However\\s*it\\s*is\\s*carried[\\s\\S]{0,60}?encumbrance\\s*of\\s*(\\d+)\\s*stone"
        }
      }
    ],
    "note": "Every shield AC bonus here is CONDITIONAL - on carry state (hand / front / back), on being mounted, and on circumstance (vulnerable, surprised, attacked from behind). The buckler depends on a proficiency instead. So none records a bare equippedAC: one number cannot say what these rules say. Only encumbrance is captured, where stated without condition."
  },
